WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.755 --> 00:00:15.535
found the shirt?"

2
00:00:15.776 --> 00:00:16.696
Henry exclaimed.

3
00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.116
"Where is it?"

4
00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:19.857
Maggie grinned.

5
00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:25.158
"On TV, detectives always want to examine the crime scene exactly as they found it.

6
00:00:26.018 --> 00:00:27.639
So I left it where I found it."

7
00:00:27.659 --> 00:00:29.999
"Let's go look," Henry said.

8
00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:31.840
"We should tell Daisy too."

9
00:00:32.724 --> 00:00:34.245
"I just saw her in the barn."

10
00:00:37.727 --> 00:00:39.648
Maggie headed back to the barn with Big Spot.

11
00:00:40.428 --> 00:00:41.069
So did Henry.

12
00:00:42.089 --> 00:00:44.130
Daisy and Kira were brushing Coco's mane.

13
00:00:45.151 --> 00:00:47.792
"Maggie found your show shirt," Henry told Daisy.

14
00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:50.114
"Really? Where?"

15
00:00:50.414 --> 00:00:51.074
Daisy cried.

16
00:00:51.094 --> 00:00:52.715
"Follow me."

17
00:00:56.477 --> 00:00:58.178
Maggie put Big Spot into his stall.

18
00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.860
Then she headed out the barn's back door.

19
00:01:02.096 --> 00:01:04.337
She stopped beside the water trough just outside.

20
00:01:04.357 --> 00:01:06.998
"Look!" Maggie said, pointing.

21
00:01:07.799 --> 00:01:10.040
A blob of white fabric was floating in the water.

22
00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.080
"My shirt!"

23
00:01:12.361 --> 00:01:13.081
Daisy shrieked.

24
00:01:14.241 --> 00:01:15.942
She reached in and grabbed the wet shirt.

25
00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.783
"Yuck! It's a mess!

26
00:01:19.444 --> 00:01:21.805
There's no way I can wear it for my class!"

27
00:01:21.825 --> 00:01:23.826
"Attention, please!"

28
00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:25.887
Ms. Wood said over the loudspeaker.

29
00:01:25.907 --> 00:01:28.988
"Riders in the next class, please come to the ring."

30
00:01:29.976 --> 00:01:30.477
"That's us."

31
00:01:30.877 --> 00:01:32.098
Kira buttoned her show coat.

32
00:01:32.118 --> 00:01:33.759
"We'd better get our ponies."

33
00:01:33.779 --> 00:01:38.704
"Okay." Daisy shoved the wet shirt at Henry.

34
00:01:38.724 --> 00:01:41.606
"You have to find out who did this.

35
00:01:42.407 --> 00:01:44.189
Whoever it is should pay!"

36
00:01:46.471 --> 00:01:48.613
The two older girls rushed back into the barn.

37
00:01:51.015 --> 00:01:52.376
Henry was examining the shirt.

38
00:01:53.497 --> 00:01:56.860
It looked just like Daisy had described, white with a ribbon on the pocket.

39
00:01:57.864 --> 00:02:00.847
"Wow, this shirt is really a mess," he said.

40
00:02:00.867 --> 00:02:02.908
"It's not just wet.

41
00:02:03.409 --> 00:02:04.730
It's stained too.

42
00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.312
There's a spot just below the ribbon."

43
00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:12.116
"Maybe the colors in the ribbon ran when they got wet," Maggie suggested.

44
00:02:12.136 --> 00:02:15.138
"That happened once when I did the laundry.

45
00:02:15.839 --> 00:02:17.260
All Dad's underwear turned pink."

46
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.142
"It can't be that," Henry said.

47
00:02:20.162 --> 00:02:22.444
"The ribbon is pink and yellow.

48
00:02:23.265 --> 00:02:24.325
This stain is blue."

49
00:02:24.345 --> 00:02:27.188
"Blue?" Maggie looked interested.

50
00:02:27.968 --> 00:02:30.210
"Like the blue stuff Big Spot slobbered on me?"

51
00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:36.677
"Maybe. It's hard to tell, since the shirt has been in the water and the spot is pretty

52
00:02:36.757 --> 00:02:38.919
faded." "Let me see."

53
00:02:39.199 --> 00:02:40.100
Maggie took the shirt.

54
00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.522
"The stain is right on the pocket.

55
00:02:43.143 --> 00:02:45.985
Maybe something in the pocket is staining it from the inside."

56
00:02:46.986 --> 00:02:48.848
She stuck her fingers into the small pocket.

57
00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.830
"Nope, nothing in here.

58
00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:52.532
But it feels sticky."

59
00:02:53.732 --> 00:02:58.194
"Maybe Daisy left gum or candy or something in the pocket earlier," Henry said.

60
00:02:58.214 --> 00:03:00.735
"That makes sense," Maggie said.

61
00:03:00.755 --> 00:03:04.356
"Those lollipops at the Dessert Den come in all kinds of colors.

62
00:03:05.337 --> 00:03:08.358
And Daisy was looking at them yesterday when we saw her there, remember?"

63
00:03:08.378 --> 00:03:11.499
"Daisy was at the Dessert Den yesterday?"

64
00:03:11.699 --> 00:03:12.300
Henry said.

65
00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.000
"I didn't see her."

66
00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.042
"She left a few minutes after we got there."

67
00:03:17.802 --> 00:03:18.422
Maggie laughed.

68
00:03:18.442 --> 00:03:22.704
"Besides, you were busy drooling over the new chocolate cake.

69
00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.661
But Cole and I talked to her."

70
00:03:24.681 --> 00:03:28.363
"So did Daisy buy any blue lollipops?"

71
00:03:28.543 --> 00:03:29.183
Henry asked.

72
00:03:29.204 --> 00:03:32.165
"If she didn't, this stain could be a clue."

73
00:03:33.086 --> 00:03:33.806
Maggie shrugged.

74
00:03:34.507 --> 00:03:35.367
"Let's go ask her.

75
00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:39.770
If she fed one to Big Spot, that would solve the mystery of the blue drool."

76
00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:45.173
"Yeah. But it wouldn't explain who took Daisy's shirt," Henry said.

77
00:03:45.193 --> 00:03:48.475
"Big Spot couldn't have put it in the water trough."

78
00:03:49.415 --> 00:03:50.336
They walked to the ring.

79
00:03:51.072 --> 00:03:53.414
"Daisy's class already started," Maggie said.

80
00:03:54.374 --> 00:03:55.055
Henry nodded.

81
00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:59.198
He watched as Daisy, Kira, and several other students rode around the ring.

82
00:04:00.199 --> 00:04:03.321
In the end Daisy won the blue ribbon, and Kira came in second.

83
00:04:08.024 --> 00:04:08.905
was great!"

84
00:04:09.185 --> 00:04:11.547
Daisy exclaimed as she and Kira rode out of the ring.

85
00:04:11.567 --> 00:04:15.650
"Hey, Kira, let's enter another class in the show.

86
00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.512
How about the obstacle course class?"

87
00:04:19.604 --> 00:04:21.005
"I can't," Kira said.

88
00:04:21.025 --> 00:04:22.366
"I don't have enough money."

89
00:04:22.386 --> 00:04:25.388
"I know how that feels," Maggie told her.

90
00:04:26.129 --> 00:04:27.210
Then she turned to Daisy.

91
00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:28.491
"Can we talk to you?"

92
00:04:28.511 --> 00:04:33.655
"Sure. I'll catch up to you in the barn," Daisy told Kira.

93
00:04:36.096 --> 00:04:38.538
She followed Henry and Maggie to a more private spot.

94
00:04:38.558 --> 00:04:40.019
"What's up?

95
00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.042
Did you guys figure out who wrecked my shirt?"

96
00:04:43.962 --> 00:04:45.844
She didn't sound as angry as she had earlier.

97
00:04:46.836 --> 00:04:49.618
Henry guessed that she was in a good mood after winning her class.

98
00:04:50.719 --> 00:04:52.301
"Not exactly," he said.

99
00:04:52.321 --> 00:04:55.303
"But we noticed a blue stain on the pocket.

100
00:04:56.144 --> 00:04:58.005
Did you put anything blue in there?"

101
00:04:58.025 --> 00:05:02.189
"Like one of those blue lollipops from the Dessert Den, for instance?"

102
00:05:02.489 --> 00:05:03.089
Maggie said.

103
00:05:03.109 --> 00:05:05.852
"Did you bring one to feed to Coco?"

104
00:05:06.692 --> 00:05:07.813
Daisy looked surprised.

105
00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:12.597
"I love those lollipops, especially the blueberry ones.

106
00:05:13.598 --> 00:05:16.000
But they're much too expensive to feed to ponies!

107
00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.701
I didn't even buy any yesterday.

108
00:05:18.721 --> 00:05:21.883
I wanted to save my money for today's show."

109
00:05:21.903 --> 00:05:24.245
"Oh," Maggie said.

110
00:05:24.265 --> 00:05:27.087
"Hey, I think Kira is calling you.

111
00:05:27.647 --> 00:05:28.888
You'd better see what she wants."

112
00:05:30.109 --> 00:05:30.649
"She is?

113
00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.331
Okay, see you guys later!"

114
00:05:35.493 --> 00:05:36.834
Daisy hurried off with her pony.

115
00:05:36.854 --> 00:05:38.755
"Why'd you say that?"

116
00:05:38.995 --> 00:05:39.595
Henry said.

117
00:05:39.615 --> 00:05:42.277
"I wanted to ask her more questions."

118
00:05:42.297 --> 00:05:46.180
"Because I just thought of a new theory," Maggie blurted out.

119
00:05:47.017 --> 00:05:50.370
"Maybe the person who wrecked Daisy's shirt is Daisy!"
